  "title": "Show HN: Omnara – Open-source alternative to Claude Managed Agents",
  "url": "https://github.com/omnara-ai/omnara",
  "discuss": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50183892",
  "score": 87,
  "comments": 26,
  "age_h": 19.4,
  "text": "Hey all, Kartik from Omnara (<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;omnara.com\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;omnara.com</a>) here. We&#x27;re building an open-source API for running durable agents. You create an agent with an API call, and Omnara runs the agent loop, gives the agent sandboxes to run commands in, and handles secrets, permissions, and RBAC. Each agent&#x27;s state is stored in Postgres, so agents survive restarts and cost nothing while idle. You can message them and stream their events over the API.<p>You may remember us from our early days, when we made a remote-control phone app for Claude Code and "
